1. One-dimensional graph — Sales Distribution by Region
1. Open a new worksheet.
2. Drag Region to Rows.
3. Drag Sales to Columns.
4. Select Bar from the Marks dropdown.
5. Set the bar color to orange, if desired.
6. Set the title to Sales Distribution by Region.

2. Two-dimensional graph — Regional Sales Breakdown by Category
1. Open a new worksheet.
2. Drag Region to Rows.
3. Drag Sales to Columns.
4. Select Bar from the Marks dropdown.
5. Drag Category to Color.
6. Go to Analysis → Stack Marks → On.
7. Set the title to Regional Sales Breakdown by Category.

3. Three-dimensional / multidimensional graph — Sales Analysis by Region and Category with Segment Breakdown
1. Open a new worksheet.
2. Drag Region to Columns.
3. Drag Segment to Columns, after Region.
4. Drag Sales to Rows.
5. Select Bar from the Marks dropdown.
6. Drag Category to Color.
7. Go to Analysis → Stack Marks → On.
8. Set the title to Sales Analysis by Region and Category with Segment Breakdown.
